    "turn_text": "to get the Kevin McCarthy as speaker. He handed the shovel to the Freedom Caucus and dug his own grave. That's what we saw come to roost this past week. And I think that the Republicans are having this internal fight, which I actually am glad they're having it, right? I'm glad that they're having this extremist versus kind of more normal. I'm glad they're pushing and pulling on each other, but it unfortunately means to the rest of the country, that it feels destabilizing, right? That we don't have a speaker at the house. The government is gonna run out of money on November 17th. So I'm really committed to making sure as soon as possible we get a new speaker. And I, frankly, I think that we should all be invested in having that happen. How that's gonna happen? Honestly, it's as good as, your guess is as good as mine. I mean, it is really gonna be a messy, I think, week or two here.",
