        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views democratic values as non-negotiable and worth risking geopolitical consequences to defend.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that Republican opposition to Ukraine aid undermines American moral authority.",
        "confidence": 0.87
